#########################################################
### Tumor   (chr22, 6,809 CpGs x 53 samples)
#########################################################

PART A - effect-size ceiling per state
  room.up   = 1 - cohort median  (largest possible hyper |dbeta| at that site)
  room.down =     cohort median  (largest possible hypo  |dbeta|)
  cells.over.0.10 = share of ALL cells at that state already >= 0.10 from their median

   L   sites= 1803  median beta=0.027  room up=0.973 down=0.027  | cells >=0.05:  3.51%  >=0.10:  0.69%  >=0.15:  0.03%
   LM  sites=  754  median beta=0.073  room up=0.927 down=0.073  | cells >=0.05: 24.72%  >=0.10: 11.60%  >=0.15:  6.07%
   M   sites=  131  median beta=0.484  room up=0.516 down=0.484  | cells >=0.05: 58.20%  >=0.10: 31.11%  >=0.15: 14.84%
   HM  sites= 1421  median beta=0.863  room up=0.137 down=0.863  | cells >=0.05: 32.29%  >=0.10: 13.24%  >=0.15:  6.45%
   H   sites=  605  median beta=0.943  room up=0.058 down=0.943  | cells >=0.05:  3.34%  >=0.10:  0.28%  >=0.15:  0.01%
